  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Expanded Spheres: Baron's Lost Apocrypha</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Admixture), Fallen Fey Sphere (Share Link).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Admixture, you may spend an additional spell point to affect one target damaged by the destructive blast with a fey-link in place of a second blast type. If you possess Bounty of the Fey, you may apply the fey-link to any targets damaged, up to your maximum targets from Bounty of the Fey.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/admixture-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
